  "scope": "Whole Federer 3.2.33, p. 270: the actual printed smooth positive-remainder example for every natural mu<m on the open unit m-cube into R^(mu+1), and impossibility for analytic maps on connected analytic m-submanifolds. Both use the original partial X,Y and public approximate Jacobian subset integral. The exact intrinsic analytic rank stratum is null or relatively open/conull, with positive original fibres on the global upper-rank branch. Both p. 270 erratum references are applied.",
  "proof_route": "Prove the actual normally convergent bump series and every higher derivative, integral primitive, strict monotonicity, cylinder coordinates, exact rank and fibre cubes, positive slab mass, full approximate graphs at every source point and original Jacobian one. Prove analytic first jets and actual Hom derivatives, actual Hilbert exterior-Gram polynomials and rank tests, intrinsic coordinate image laws, connected chart-zero continuation through local null transport and nonnull relative open pieces, actual constant-rank positive fibres, almost-everywhere exact relative/approximate graph agreement, and zero original analytic remainder integral.",
